<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish industrial output rises 9.9 pct in Nov-CSO.</title>
<headline>Irish industrial output rises 9.9 pct in Nov-CSO.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish industrial production rose a seasonally adjusted 9.9 percent in November after a 5.0 percent rise in October, Central Statistics Office (CSO) data showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>Manufacturing production rose 8.8 percent in November after a rise of 5.5 percent the previous month.  </p>
